<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your Activation Code</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f7f2fa;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            table-layout: fixed;
            background-color: #f7f2fa;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .main-table {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            border-spacing: 0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(106, 27, 154, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #4a148c; /* Darkest Purple */
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
            color: #444444;
            line-height: 1.6;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .username {
            color: #6a1b9a;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 20px;
        }
        .code-container {
            margin: 30px 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f3e5f5;
            border: 2px dashed #9c27b0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .activation-code {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            color: #7b1fa2;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .footer {
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #9e9e9e;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <center class="wrapper">
        <table class="main-table" role="presentation">
            <tr>
                <td class="header">
                    <h1 style="color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px;">Verify Your Account</h1>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="content">
                    <p style="font-size: 18px;">Hi <span class="username"><%= user.name %></span>,</p>
                    <p>Welcome! We're thrilled to have you. To finish setting up your account, please use the activation code below in the app:</p>
                    
                    <div class="code-container">
                        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8e24aa; font-weight: bold;">Your Activation Code</p>
                        <h2 class="activation-code"><%= activationCode %></h2>
                    </div>

                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #777;">This code will expire in 5 minutes for security reasons.</p>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="footer">
                    <p>If you didn't request this email, please ignore it or contact support.</p>
                    <p style="margin-top: 10px;">&copy; 2026 YourBrand. Powered by Creativity.</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </center>
</body>
</html>